From: "Claude (draft)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:04:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add shared SMS categorisation engine and preview-based
 re-categorise

- New pure-Kotlin SmsCategorizer used by automatic import, the hourly sync
  and the manual SMS scan (matches payee, then sender, then SMS text).
- Rules for CRED, Dreamplug, Amazon, Flipkart, Swiggy, Zomato; distinguishes
  bank transfers, own-account transfers and person-to-person UPI payments.
- Category names now come from the app's default category list; Shopping,
  Education, Insurance, Bills/Credit card, Bank transfer, Own account
  transfer and Person-to-person are added to the defaults.
- Colours and icons for the new categories.
- Transaction.categoryOrigin (auto/manual) persisted in storage and backups;
  editing a category marks it manual.
- Settings > Import: preview-based re-categorisation of SMS-imported
  expenses labelled Other. Never touches manual categories; changes only the
  category and origin so duplicate detection keys are preserved.
- Tests for every rule id, the re-categoriser and the default-list contract.
